{"type":"after","callId":"call@1157","endTime":301248.904,"result":{"value":"C\nCHURVOX\nCOMMAND DESK\nAI OPERATOR\nPrepared admin. You approve.\n\nCOMMAND\n\nCM\nCommand Board\n\nWORK\n\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nCrew Dispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\n\nCREW & ADMIN\n\nTM\nTeam\nPR\nPayroll\nRP\nReports\n\nSYSTEM\n\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\n?\nSupport\nBUILD DIRECT-WORKBENCH-SIDEBAR-CLEAR\nC\nCHURVOX\nAI OPERATOR APPROVAL DESK\nChurvox did the admin. You approve.\n\nAI Operator prepares the work that needs attention. You open one focused slip, see what Churvox found, edit anything, then approve or decline.\n\nTODAY\nAI lanes ready\nReview the slips, then approve.\nWAITING\nOwner decisions\nNo risky silent changes.\nFOCUS\nMoney + dispatch\nCashflow and crew first.\nRULE\nApprove-first\nChurvox prepares. You control.\nTODAY’S FOCUS\nStart with money, crew, and approvals.\n\nThose are the actions most likely to block cashflow, customer updates, worker assignment, or the next job step.\n\nReview money\nAssign crew\nApprovals\nOWNER QUEUE\nAPPROVAL DECISION\nApprovals\n\nOne master place for the yes, edit, or decline decisions Churvox prepared.\n\nOpen queue\nNEEDS APPROVAL\nINVOICE APPROVAL\nMoney\n\nInvoice drafts, overdue follow-ups, delivery choices and accounting checks.\n\nReview money\nDISPATCH READY\nCREW ASSIGNMENT\nCrew dispatch\n\nWorker recommendations, schedule checks, conflicts and field notes.\n\nAssign crew\nMISSING INFO\nJOB BLOCKER FIX\nJobs needing info\n\nJobs missing price, notes, client details, schedule or assignment before they move.\n\nFix jobs\nFOLLOW-UP READY\nQUOTE ACTION\nQuotes\n\nQuote follow-ups, revisions and quote-to-job actions prepared for review.\n\nReview quotes\nDATA CLEANUP\nCLIENT RECORD FIX\nClients\n\nClient contact fixes, site notes, billing contacts and next customer action.\n\nCheck clients\nFIELD REVIEW\nWORKER UPDATE REVIEW\nWorker updates\n\nWorker notes, proof photos, time issues and completion checks before invoicing.\n\nReview updates\nTIME CHECK\nPAYROLL TIME REVIEW\nPayroll/time\n\nReviewed hours, pause time, holds and payroll handoff decisions.\n\nReview time\nSETUP REQUIRED\nSETUP BLOCKER FIX\nSetup blockers\n\nBilling, Xero, legal, branding, team and trust items that can block launch.\n\nFinish setup\nAI OPERATOR SLIPS\nChurvox prepared this\n\nReal admin found from jobs, invoices, quotes and crew. Approve it, edit it, or open the full record.\n\n0\nNo urgent slips right now.\n\nChurvox checked jobs, invoices, quotes and crew. Nothing needs approval at this moment."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@1157"}
